shinyUI(

  fluidPage(

      mainPanel(

      leaflet::leafletOutput(outputId = "map"),

      plotly::plotlyOutput(outputId = "plot")

    )
  ) #! end fluidPage
) #! end shinyUI

Thank you very much in advance if someone can provide me with a solution to this problem.

Regards,
